  "details": "Repeat post of this https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-pickup-layer-to-camera\n\nThis feature make it possible to make transparant photos WITH pickups like sword or weapon.\n\nEspecially if you go around in game worlds, what do you think as streamer? You're running around but nothing visible in hands. Actually kinda bummer.\n\nVRChat streamers will love this toggle, because it adds more fun for streamers using 2-camera setup, where second has transparent on as overlay on first face camera.\n\nI am sad the idea is never accepted because it's very simple request.",
